---
description: Editorial content file rules
globs:
  - "content/**/*.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

A page may be changed from draft=true to draft=false only when:
- summary contains a direct useful answer;
- sections contain complete original prose;
- facts and model details are verified;
- required tables are supplied where applicable;
- internal links and relatedPageIds are reviewed;
- affiliate disclosure appears before links;
- ASIN and image fields are validated;
- no invented testing or product experience appears;
- title, description, canonical and schema match visible content;
- editorial QA is complete.
